{"schemaVersion":1,"id":29,"sections":[{"id":"112010-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[940],"start":0,"count":8},{"id":"112010-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10930],"start":8,"count":8},{"id":"112011-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[950],"start":16,"count":14},{"id":"112011-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10940],"start":30,"count":14},{"id":"112012-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[960],"start":44,"count":9},{"id":"112012-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10950],"start":53,"count":5},{"id":"112013-PROLOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战前","scripts":[970],"start":58,"count":3},{"id":"112013-EPILOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战后","scripts":[10960],"start":61,"count":3},{"id":"112014-PROLOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战前","scripts":[980],"start":64,"count":9},{"id":"112014-EPILOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战后","scripts":[10970],"start":73,"count":14}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:2","scriptId":940,"text":"观测席上----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":292,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:3","scriptId":940,"text":"“这……竟然有能使用攻城兵器的钢舞姬混在队伍里，你们也实在太阴险了！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:4","scriptId":940,"text":"“啊？你说什么？我听不到？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":219,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":292,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:5","scriptId":940,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":219,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:6","scriptId":940,"text":"“下面这场已经是赛点了呀，看来这次胜利是属于伏龙芝的了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":219,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":292,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:7","scriptId":940,"text":"“哼，只要还有一丝希望，我们桑赫斯特是绝对不会放弃的！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":219,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:8","scriptId":940,"text":"“让我们拭目以待～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":292,"right":219,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":230,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-PROLOGUE:940:9","scriptId":940,"text":"（唉……这两人真是一对活宝……，不过桑赫斯特的补给已经见底，从牌面上看伏龙芝已经提前胜利了。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":230,"right":219,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:1","scriptId":10930,"text":"桑赫斯特临时指挥部----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":230,"right":219,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":757,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:2","scriptId":10930,"text":"“汇报一下，人员状况吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":757,"right":219,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":264,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:3","scriptId":10930,"text":"“是……队长和芬妮轻度损伤，我和塞姬中度损伤，安娜和利薇尔做了应急处理，但由于物资不足，只能勉强做到最低战斗保障。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":757,"right":264,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":757,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:4","scriptId":10930,"text":"“恩……形势比较严峻，下一场又是攻防战，伏龙芝占据防守地利，对我们极其不利……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":757,"right":264,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":264,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:5","scriptId":10930,"text":"“是的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":757,"right":264,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":761,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:6","scriptId":10930,"text":"“但是！我们绝对不会因为这点困难而放弃希望！要让伏龙芝那伙人知道我们桑赫斯特的毅力！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":264,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":268,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:7","scriptId":10930,"text":"“是！绝对不辜负队长大人的期望！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":268,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":263,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112010-EPILOGUE:10930:8","scriptId":10930,"text":"（啊……队长大人真是太帅气了～）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":761,"right":263,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:2","scriptId":950,"text":"“考虑到桑赫斯特的配置，她们的攻击无非就是正面突击和各种包夹作战。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":263,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:3","scriptId":950,"text":"“然而以目前她们的状态来看兵力上应该不足以施展包夹作战，所以选择正面突击的可能性非常大。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":263,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:4","scriptId":950,"text":"“她们也可以先进行超远程炮击骚扰啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:5","scriptId":950,"text":"“从我得来的消息是桑赫斯特的远程攻击火力不是特别强，所以不用担心她们的超远程炮击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:6","scriptId":950,"text":"“长官从哪里得来的消息？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:7","scriptId":950,"text":"“这是商业机密～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:8","scriptId":950,"text":"（塞姬真是个好人啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:9","scriptId":950,"text":"“一股浓浓的卖关子感……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":350,"speaker":"茜罗娅·约德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:10","scriptId":950,"text":"“恩，我的攻城炮弹也已经用得差不多了，下面就和正常一样使用普通榴弹作战了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":350,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:11","scriptId":950,"text":"“没关系，反正最重要的一战已经完成，非常给力！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":350,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":354,"speaker":"茜罗娅·约德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:12","scriptId":950,"text":"“哈哈～谢谢夸奖～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":354,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":172,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:13","scriptId":950,"text":"“如果她们这次再从正面突击，我一定要把她们给挡下来！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":172,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:14","scriptId":950,"text":"“恩，我会一雪前耻的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-PROLOGUE:950:15","scriptId":950,"text":"“恩，看上去气势不错，就照这个势头拿下这局，奠定胜利吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:1","scriptId":10940,"text":"果然如预料的一样，桑赫斯特小队直接从正面一路奔袭而来！","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:2","scriptId":10940,"text":"“这直勾勾地冲过来，真的没关系吗～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:3","scriptId":10940,"text":"“火炮队开始对她们进行地毯式轰炸！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":98,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:4","scriptId":10940,"text":"“好的，现在就开始火力攻击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":98,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":352,"speaker":"茜罗娅·约德尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:5","scriptId":10940,"text":"“OK～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":352,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:6","scriptId":10940,"text":"一轮炮击过后，桑赫斯特小队基本毫发无伤……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":352,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:7","scriptId":10940,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":352,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:8","scriptId":10940,"text":"烟尘散去，定睛一看，原来桑赫斯特小队排成一字纵队，由前排装甲厚实的芬妮吸收了大量的火炮伤害。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":352,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:9","scriptId":10940,"text":"“我的攻击都跳弹了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":88,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:10","scriptId":10940,"text":"“别管那么多，继续射击，就算是跳弹，也是能造成一定损伤的，瞄准履带和膝盖！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:11","scriptId":10940,"text":"“好吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:12","scriptId":10940,"text":"然而佐伊她们的射击不是被弹开就是未命中，眨眼间芬妮等人已经杀到据点门口。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":88,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:13","scriptId":10940,"text":"（这气魄，真是有点吓人……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112011-EPILOGUE:10940:14","scriptId":10940,"text":"“准备迎击敌人！近距离的刺刀战了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:2","scriptId":960,"text":"由于桑赫斯特小队展现出了惊人的突击能力，一口气攻到了据点门口。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":172,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:3","scriptId":960,"text":"“这次可不会让你们突破了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":172,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":296,"speaker":"芬妮·朱安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:4","scriptId":960,"text":"“多说无益，闪开！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":172,"right":296,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:8","scriptId":960,"text":"芬妮率先发动了一轮连续射击，由于连发的特性，很容易就把门口给压制住了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":296,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:9","scriptId":960,"text":"趁着芬妮换弹夹的间隙，奈乐突然闪出对着芬妮的正面就是一炮。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":296,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:12","scriptId":960,"text":"可惜炮弹并没有造成伤害，而是被芬妮厚实的装甲弹开了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":null,"right":296,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:13","scriptId":960,"text":"“可恶！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":296,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":762,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:14","scriptId":960,"text":"“还想偷袭！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":762,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112012-PROLOGUE:960:15","scriptId":960,"text":"奥菲利亚补上了芬妮的空缺，也开始了射击---","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":762,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112012-EPILOGUE:10950:1","scriptId":10950,"text":"战斗进入了白热化，谁都不会退让一步。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":103,"right":762,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112012-EPILOGUE:10950:2","scriptId":10950,"text":"而观测台上----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":103,"right":762,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112012-EPILOGUE:10950:3","scriptId":10950,"text":"“恩……从目前的情况，看来只要顶住桑赫斯特这波最后的突击，伏龙芝就稳操胜券了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":223,"right":762,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112012-EPILOGUE:10950:4","scriptId":10950,"text":"“没错，虽然桑赫斯特最后这股狠劲确实狠让人佩服，但是也就到此为止了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":223,"right":219,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":288,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112012-EPILOGUE:10950:5","scriptId":10950,"text":"“……虽然不想承认……但是奥菲利亚她们的补给问题马上就会浮出水面了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":288,"right":219,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112013-PROLOGUE:970:2","scriptId":970,"text":"战况非常激烈，桑赫斯特队的塞姬、安娜以及利薇尔都已经身负重伤，然而她们还没有丝毫放弃的迹象。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":288,"right":219,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112013-PROLOGUE:970:3","scriptId":970,"text":"“呃，没想到桑赫斯特队如此顽强，都打到这个时候了，还没有放弃……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112013-PROLOGUE:970:4","scriptId":970,"text":"“不过她们再怎么抵抗也就那样了，没有翻盘的希望了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112013-EPILOGUE:10960:1","scriptId":10960,"text":"虽然在气势上桑赫斯特小队完全压过了伏龙芝小队。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112013-EPILOGUE:10960:2","scriptId":10960,"text":"但是在状态和弹药物资上，两队有着明显的差距。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112013-EPILOGUE:10960:3","scriptId":10960,"text":"这预示着比赛也要进入尾声了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:2","scriptId":980,"text":"对面的炮火攻击频率终于开始慢慢下降，比赛的尾声也理所当然的到来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:3","scriptId":980,"text":"“差不多了吧，你们已经没有弹药了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":219,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":752,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:4","scriptId":980,"text":"“可恶！！如果还有那么一点点弹药的话，应该还是有希望攻下来的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":103,"right":752,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:5","scriptId":980,"text":"“看来比赛就该到此为止了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":163,"right":752,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:6","scriptId":980,"text":"“射得我手都酸了……，虽然都没几炮打中的……打中的好像也弹飞了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":40,"right":752,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:7","scriptId":980,"text":"“如果她们的补给是比较充足的话，输得肯定就是我们了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:8","scriptId":980,"text":"“噗噗噗～但是谁让她们那么不注意物资回收呢？这怪不了别人～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:9","scriptId":980,"text":"“你们看看，果然都在我的预料之内啊，物资问题不注意啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-PROLOGUE:980:10","scriptId":980,"text":"“长官不要在无线电里自说自话了……会影响我们的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:1","scriptId":10970,"text":"比赛迎来了结局，第二轮攻防战伏龙芝队获胜，这样最终，伏龙芝以3:1的成绩在军演上战胜了桑赫斯特小队。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:2","scriptId":10970,"text":"沙狐小队的蕾贝卡队长开始作了下总结。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":40,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:3","scriptId":10970,"text":"“恩，这次的军演非常精彩，虽然桑赫斯特小队最后因为弹药补给问题输给了伏龙芝，但是她们战斗到了最后一刻也是虽败犹荣。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:4","scriptId":10970,"text":"“伏龙芝小队在战斗初期就利用自己队伍的优势，不惜放弃第一战的胜利，以最快速度收集完物资。看来是从一开始就以耗尽对手为目标，真是目的明确且执行力优秀的队伍。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:5","scriptId":10970,"text":"“总的来说两支队伍都展现出了自身的本领，通过这次军演应该能让你们两支队伍有长足的进步。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":225,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:6","scriptId":10970,"text":"“那么祝贺伏龙芝小队获得了这次军演的胜利！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":225,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:7","scriptId":10970,"text":"（终于完事了，可以回死水总部了……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":223,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:8","scriptId":10970,"text":"“队长好像一脸疲惫的样子……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":223,"right":247,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":235,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:9","scriptId":10970,"text":"“队长那是精神疲劳，一会儿就会好的啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":235,"right":247,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":237,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:10","scriptId":10970,"text":"“普莉玛她们这次的发挥还算不错，比想象中的要好不少啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":237,"right":247,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":249,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:11","scriptId":10970,"text":"“那是当然，之前传授她们的作战诀窍可是货真价实的实战经验。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":237,"right":249,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:13","scriptId":10970,"text":"军演之后----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:14","scriptId":10970,"text":"索菲亚教官对此次军演成绩非常满意，总算是替伏龙芝出了口气，灭了灭桑赫斯特的威风。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"112014-EPILOGUE:10970:15","scriptId":10970,"text":"于是军演就此告一段落。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":9,"shake":false}],"summaries":["看台上的索菲亚和伊莎贝尔……","防守战第二轮开始！伏龙芝防守模式。","防守战第二轮开始"]}
